sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Search the catalog before restoring the archive
accDescr: A metadata lookup returns the Glacier archive identifier. Restoration then occurs as an asynchronous job before its bytes can be downloaded.
participant U as Retrieval workflow
participant D as DynamoDB catalog
participant G as Legacy Glacier vault
U->>D: Indexed dataset search
D-->>U: Dataset metadata and archive ID
U->>G: Initiate archive retrieval job
G-->>U: Job ID
Note over U,G: Asynchronous retrieval interval
G-->>U: Job completion notification
U->>G: Download job output
G-->>U: Compressed dataset
Note over U: Decompress and deliver within tested objective
